1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:07,042
In a new area, wondering what time Jama’at starts at a nearby mosque?

2
00:00:07,192 --> 00:00:15,583
That is the idea behind DiscoverSalah: make mosques and Jama’at times easier to find.

3
00:00:16,383 --> 00:00:25,750
Choose your area, browse listed mosques and check Jama’at times. No account needed.

4
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:37,250
Prayer time and congregation time are different. The focus here is Jama’at timings.

5
00:00:38,050 --> 00:00:46,667
Found a mosque? Check its details and notices, then open Google Maps for directions.

6
00:00:46,817 --> 00:00:56,583
Check the timing before leaving and allow extra travel time. Arrival on time is not guaranteed.

7
00:00:57,383 --> 00:01:04,750
It is a shared effort. A local mosque representative submits new timings or changes.

8
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:15,333
A focal person checks the update with the Imam. An admin helps organise the team.

9
00:01:16,133 --> 00:01:26,500
An update is checked by another responsible person before approval, or returned for correction.

10
00:01:26,650 --> 00:01:35,583
Nobody approves their own update. Future timings take effect on their planned date.

11
00:01:36,383 --> 00:01:45,792
Notice an incorrect time or a missing mosque? Send a report or suggest the mosque.

12
00:01:45,942 --> 00:01:58,083
Apply to help and track your request. Private Imam phone numbers are not shown publicly.

13
00:01:58,883 --> 00:02:08,458
The goal is simple: easy-to-find Jama’at times, checked information and a helpful community.

14
00:02:08,608 --> 00:02:17,583
That is DiscoverSalah. Stay connected with your mosque and help make someone else’s day easier.
